    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ok {race} buddy, it time for Skonk favorite part. Skonk have fire hot and ready, and want to share new dish with new friend. You do such big favors for Skonk; it only right you get some too!\r\n\r\nLet Skonk know when you ready for tasting.",
      "summary": "Taste test the recipe with Skonk.",
      "title": "Taste Testing",
